<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paxson as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paxson as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Drew Marcus initiated both Paxson Communications Corp and Telemundo Group Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Paxson shares fell 1/8 to 10-5/8, while Telemundo gained 3/4 to 29.</p>
</text>
